WEBVTT

00:05.630 --> 00:10.343
["Islands in the Stream" by
Kenny Rogers & Dolly Parton]

00:10.927 --> 00:14.389
♪ ...Hold me closer,
and I feel no pain ♪

00:14.389 --> 00:17.142
- ♪ Every beat of my heart ♪
- [adding machine whirs]

00:17.142 --> 00:20.854
♪ We got somethin' goin' on ♪

00:20.854 --> 00:23.231
[adding machine whirring]

00:23.231 --> 00:27.318
♪ Tender love is blind
It requires... ♪

00:27.444 --> 00:28.486
Ma.

00:29.487 --> 00:33.908
♪ All this love we feel
Needs no conversation ♪

00:33.908 --> 00:36.661
♪ We ride it together,
ah-ah... ♪

00:36.786 --> 00:38.538
Ma, you almost done?

00:39.039 --> 00:40.123
Still workin', baby.

00:41.374 --> 00:43.001
It's the weekend.

00:44.044 --> 00:46.588
How 'bout we watch a movie,
one of the old ones you like?

00:46.588 --> 00:47.714
Maybe later.

00:49.299 --> 00:50.508
It's a date then.

00:51.134 --> 00:52.093
[laughs]

00:52.719 --> 00:53.928
Oh, yeah?

00:54.471 --> 00:55.847
Who's payin'?

00:56.348 --> 00:58.516
Oh, look at this face.

00:58.641 --> 01:01.728
My big, strong bull of a boy.

01:03.063 --> 01:05.774
You're gettin' so handsome,
I can't take it.

01:06.733 --> 01:08.860
[Jack and Benny
roaring and shrieking playfully]

01:08.985 --> 01:10.695
Boys, not inside!
You'll break something,

01:10.820 --> 01:12.280
runnin' around like lunatics.

01:12.280 --> 01:14.199
- Jack, stop it!
- [Jack roars]

01:14.324 --> 01:16.368
[Francis] Benny, what the hell
are you doing?

01:16.493 --> 01:17.952
Do you hear me?
Get out of there!

01:17.952 --> 01:19.537
God damn it!

01:21.206 --> 01:22.165
Sorry, Ma.

01:22.165 --> 01:23.458
You're in trouble now.

01:26.628 --> 01:28.046
'Cause we...

01:28.880 --> 01:33.093
are a zombie family.

01:33.093 --> 01:34.761
[Benny] No! [giggles] No!

01:34.886 --> 01:37.013
[Francis] I'm gonna eat
those sweet brains.

01:37.013 --> 01:38.098
- [Benny] No!
- Let's feast!

01:38.098 --> 01:39.516
[Benny] No!

01:39.516 --> 01:41.226
[Francis] Delicious brains!

01:41.226 --> 01:43.269
- My favorite. What a treat!
- [Jack groaning]

01:43.269 --> 01:44.396
Jack, come here, sweetheart.

01:44.521 --> 01:47.107
[Benny] Now I'm a zombie.

01:47.107 --> 01:50.985
- Must eat Ozzie's brain.
- Benny!

01:50.985 --> 01:52.362
Will you take the boys out
for me?

01:52.362 --> 01:54.531
You got it, Mom. Of course.

01:54.531 --> 01:56.449
Thank you. My good boy.

01:56.574 --> 01:57.534
Go take 'em.

01:57.534 --> 02:00.245
All right, Benny, Oz,

02:00.370 --> 02:02.372
get your coats.
We're going outside for a while.

02:02.497 --> 02:04.958
Nah. I'm gonna stay and help Ma.

02:05.083 --> 02:07.711
Oswald, you need
to exercise your leg,

02:07.711 --> 02:08.962
build up your strength.

02:09.963 --> 02:11.256
[sighs] Benny.

02:13.049 --> 02:14.175
Hold still.

02:14.634 --> 02:16.469
This stupid zipper!

02:16.594 --> 02:18.763
[sighs] I'm sorry, biscuit.

02:18.888 --> 02:21.599
We'll get you a new coat soon.
[kisses]

02:22.308 --> 02:24.227
Oh, and, Jack, I want you
to find Rex down there

02:24.227 --> 02:25.812
and give him his book, will ya?

02:25.937 --> 02:27.188
Oswald, give me the book.

02:28.064 --> 02:29.858
- I can do it.
- I said Jack.

02:30.400 --> 02:31.526
- [Jack] Okay.
- [Francis] Go on.

02:31.526 --> 02:32.610
Let's go.

02:37.282 --> 02:39.242
Oh, and, boys, the second
those streetlights come on,

02:39.242 --> 02:41.077
I want your little asses home.
Ya hear me?

02:41.077 --> 02:42.454
[boys] Yes, Ma.

02:46.249 --> 02:47.751
[horns honking]

02:47.751 --> 02:49.961
- I don't wanna play baseball.
- You don't wanna play baseball,

02:50.086 --> 02:52.547
- what do you wanna play?
- I don't know. Soccer.

02:52.547 --> 02:53.506
Damn.

02:54.090 --> 02:55.300
Look at those rims.

02:57.969 --> 03:00.305
Rex must be the richest guy
in Gotham.

03:00.972 --> 03:02.057
Is it made of real gold?

03:02.057 --> 03:04.309
No, Benny, it's just paint.

03:05.143 --> 03:06.311
Gotta be something, though, huh?

03:06.436 --> 03:08.813
[man whimpers] I'm sorry.

03:09.647 --> 03:11.775
Get him up. Get his ass up.

03:11.775 --> 03:14.069
- Been waitin' all week...
- Hey, we should come back later.

03:14.069 --> 03:16.279
- Rex!
- [Jack] Hey.

03:16.279 --> 03:17.739
[Rex] Jackie boy, that you?

03:18.406 --> 03:19.532
Shit!

03:19.532 --> 03:21.284
Fuckin' Popeye over here.

03:21.284 --> 03:22.410
Come here.

03:23.703 --> 03:24.746
Stay here with Benny.

03:24.746 --> 03:26.206
Ma don't want
you getting involved.

03:26.206 --> 03:29.209
Hey, fellas, you remember
Francis Cobb's son?

03:30.168 --> 03:32.879
He's joinin' the ROTC,
be a hero. Ain't that right?

03:33.672 --> 03:34.756
[Jack] Yeah.

03:34.756 --> 03:35.882
What you got for me?

03:39.636 --> 03:40.845
[dramatic musical sting]

03:46.184 --> 03:48.144
- [Rex] How's your mom doing?
- [Jack] She's all right.

03:48.144 --> 03:49.688
Give her my regards.

03:55.026 --> 03:57.362
Hey, Rex. Nice to see ya.

03:59.030 --> 04:00.824
Oz, watch your mouth.

04:01.741 --> 04:03.785
- How much he give ya?
- Fifty. Come on.

04:03.785 --> 04:05.370
Holy shit! Can I see?

04:05.495 --> 04:08.415
We can go to the arcade
and play Double Dragon forever.

04:08.415 --> 04:09.749
No. I'm gonna give it to Ma.

04:09.749 --> 04:12.252
[thunder rumbles]

04:12.252 --> 04:14.087
Rain's coming.
We gotta get inside.

04:14.212 --> 04:15.547
Benny, you wanna play
flashlight tag?

04:15.672 --> 04:17.924
- Yes. Flashlight tag.
- Yeah?

04:18.049 --> 04:21.386
- [train trundling]
- [rain pouring]

04:21.511 --> 04:23.763
Mr. Calabrese don't pay Ma
nearly enough,

04:23.888 --> 04:25.724
nothing close
to what she deserves.

04:25.849 --> 04:27.267
What are you talkin' about?

04:27.267 --> 04:29.310
He just gave us 50 bucks.

04:29.310 --> 04:31.563
Look, I'm tellin' you,
he ain't a good guy.

04:32.522 --> 04:34.524
You ever wonder
where he gets all that money?

04:34.524 --> 04:35.734
I don't have to.

04:36.860 --> 04:38.153
He's a gangster.

04:38.153 --> 04:40.447
- [thunder rumbles]
- [Jack] Now it's coming down.

04:42.407 --> 04:44.117
Here we go. Here we go.

04:47.245 --> 04:48.246
Benny, you first.

04:49.706 --> 04:50.749
Here you go. Oz.

04:58.423 --> 04:59.424
[Benny] Got 'em.

05:02.802 --> 05:04.095
I'm keepin' the red one.

05:04.596 --> 05:06.306
Ozzie, you're it first.

05:06.890 --> 05:07.766
Fine.

05:08.308 --> 05:10.060
Count to 10... slowly.

05:10.060 --> 05:11.269
And no peekin'.

05:13.104 --> 05:14.272
[Jack] Go. Let's go.

05:15.315 --> 05:20.445
One, two, three, four...

05:22.530 --> 05:23.365
...ten.

05:23.365 --> 05:24.949
[somber music playing]

05:25.658 --> 05:27.118
Ready or not...

05:33.583 --> 05:35.377
[Oz] I know
you're here somewhere.

05:37.462 --> 05:40.632
[music turns eerie]

05:52.519 --> 05:54.979
- [metallic thudding]
- [Benny giggles in distance]

05:57.607 --> 06:00.110
- [Benny giggling]
- [Jack, tauntingly] Oz.

06:00.110 --> 06:01.861
[Oz] Guys, come on.
This is bullshit.

06:01.861 --> 06:04.489
You're supposed to stay
in the station.

06:05.323 --> 06:06.324
[grunts]

06:06.449 --> 06:07.992
[sighs] You gotta be kiddin' me.

06:08.702 --> 06:10.286
[metal scraping]

06:10.286 --> 06:12.997
[Benny giggling]

06:12.997 --> 06:15.041
[Oz] Hey! I can hear you
down there.

06:15.166 --> 06:16.501
[Benny] Then come get us.

06:17.168 --> 06:18.586
I found you.

06:18.586 --> 06:20.672
Shouldn't have to flash
this stupid light in your faces

06:20.797 --> 06:21.589
for it to count.

06:21.589 --> 06:22.507
[Benny giggles]

06:22.632 --> 06:23.883
[Jack] You know the rules, Oz.

06:24.384 --> 06:25.385
[Benny giggles]

06:25.510 --> 06:26.511
Fine.

06:26.636 --> 06:28.471
[Benny giggles] Hurry up!

06:28.471 --> 06:29.889
- [grunts]
- [Benny] Come on, Ozzie.

06:32.308 --> 06:34.394
[grunting]

06:35.353 --> 06:36.521
- [clanks]
- [grunts]

06:37.147 --> 06:39.274
- [Jack] Hey, Oz, you okay?
- Screw this!

06:39.274 --> 06:41.276
- [Jack] Oz.
- Screw you guys!

06:43.403 --> 06:44.612
[Jack] Oz, what's going on?

06:44.612 --> 06:46.781
You know it's hard
for me to get down there!

06:46.781 --> 06:48.033
I'm sorry, Oz.

06:48.700 --> 06:50.201
We'll start over, all right?

06:50.326 --> 06:51.995
I'll be it this time.
You and Benny can hide.

06:52.120 --> 06:53.371
[thuds shut]

06:53.496 --> 06:55.123
Have fun gettin' out!

06:55.123 --> 06:56.207
[Jack] Hey.

06:57.208 --> 06:58.084
Oz?

06:58.585 --> 07:00.962
- Oz, open the door.
- [Benny] Oz! Don't--

07:00.962 --> 07:02.756
[Jack] Get back here
and open this door.

07:02.756 --> 07:03.715
[rain pouring]

07:03.715 --> 07:05.675
- [Jack] Oz?
- [Benny] Please!

07:05.675 --> 07:08.553
- [thunder rumbling]
- [rain pouring]

07:09.763 --> 07:13.141
["Only You" by Yazoo playing]

07:13.141 --> 07:15.727
♪ Listen to the words
that you say... ♪

07:15.852 --> 07:18.855
[adding machine whirring]

07:18.855 --> 07:21.649
♪ When I see you ♪

07:22.859 --> 07:26.571
♪ All I needed was
the love you gave ♪

07:27.364 --> 07:29.240
♪ All I needed
for another... ♪

07:29.366 --> 07:32.410
Oswald, Jesus! You're soaking.
What happened?

07:32.911 --> 07:33.787
Come here.

07:36.081 --> 07:37.082
Where are your brothers?

07:37.207 --> 07:38.416
They went to the movies.

07:38.541 --> 07:39.793
With what money?

07:40.710 --> 07:42.462
Rex gave Jack some cash.

07:43.546 --> 07:44.422
Why didn't you go?

07:44.923 --> 07:46.257
I wanted to be with you.

07:47.467 --> 07:49.594
Jack shouldn't have let you
walk home by yourself.

07:50.428 --> 07:51.846
I don't need Jack's help.

07:52.305 --> 07:53.181
Course not.

07:53.932 --> 07:56.643
'Cause my Oswald's tough...

07:57.727 --> 08:00.980
and gettin' stronger
every goddamn day.

08:02.065 --> 08:04.442
What do ya say
we watch our own movie, huh?

08:05.110 --> 08:06.444
Have our little date?

08:06.986 --> 08:08.405
Can I pick which one?

08:08.405 --> 08:11.533
Well, you always pick
the same damn thing, but sure.

08:12.784 --> 08:14.869
[rain pouring]

08:14.869 --> 08:17.664
[thunder rumbling]

08:20.083 --> 08:22.669
Oswald, what movie did you say
they went to?

08:25.296 --> 08:27.799
I'm worried I'm gonna have to
pick 'em up with all this rain.

08:27.924 --> 08:31.386
[clock chiming]

08:33.346 --> 08:34.347
Uh...

08:35.015 --> 08:37.350
Beetlejuice, I think.

08:37.934 --> 08:39.394
Here, I made your favorite,

08:39.394 --> 08:40.854
whiskey and soda.

08:42.981 --> 08:43.815
Thank you.

08:43.940 --> 08:45.233
[muffled shouting]

08:45.233 --> 08:47.569
Oh, Christ. What I wouldn't do
to get out of here.

08:47.569 --> 08:50.864
Live in one of them penthouses
all the celebrities buy.

08:50.864 --> 08:52.490
That'd be nice, huh?

08:52.615 --> 08:53.783
Top floor.

08:53.783 --> 08:57.746
No one above ya or beside ya.

08:57.746 --> 08:58.830
One day, Ma.

09:01.708 --> 09:03.084
You ready to watch the movie?

09:06.004 --> 09:06.838
Yeah.

09:09.716 --> 09:11.926
- You warm enough?
- Yeah.

09:11.926 --> 09:14.262
- You?
- Yeah. Cozy.

09:14.971 --> 09:15.889
[TV turns on]

09:16.139 --> 09:19.768
["Top Hat, White Tie and Tails"
playing]

09:22.479 --> 09:25.023
[shoes tapping loudly]

09:33.365 --> 09:36.242
[rain pouring]

09:42.707 --> 09:45.377
[shoes tapping loudly]

09:48.880 --> 09:49.756
[thunder crashes]

09:49.881 --> 09:52.175
[electricity buzzing]

09:52.175 --> 09:53.551
[Jack] Let us out!

09:54.886 --> 09:56.137
[Benny] Let me out!

09:56.137 --> 09:58.056
- [pounding on door]
- [Jack] Please let us out!

09:58.765 --> 10:00.016
[Benny shouts indistinctly]

10:00.016 --> 10:01.810
["Top Hat, White Tie and Tails"
continues]

10:01.810 --> 10:03.478
[dancers stomping loudly]

10:09.275 --> 10:12.404
[Astaire's cane "popping"
like a gun]

10:15.115 --> 10:16.783
- [Benny] Help!
- [Jack] Help!

10:17.409 --> 10:19.953
Please let us out of here!

10:19.953 --> 10:21.830
- [thudding on door]
- [Benny] Help!

10:21.830 --> 10:24.958
- [Jack and Benny gurgling]
- [water rushing]

10:24.958 --> 10:27.127
["Top Hat, White Tie and Tails"
continues]

10:37.929 --> 10:39.431
- [music crescendos]
- [kissing]

10:39.556 --> 10:40.473
[song ends]

10:40.473 --> 10:42.267
[rain pouring]

10:51.401 --> 10:52.819
[sirens in distance]

11:01.453 --> 11:02.287
[Oz] Beautiful.

11:05.081 --> 11:06.791
Thank you, Councilman.

11:07.459 --> 11:08.293
[sighs]

11:10.003 --> 11:11.171
[menacing music playing]

11:16.051 --> 11:16.926
Ma?

11:19.220 --> 11:20.180
Ma?

11:21.264 --> 11:22.182
Vic?

11:25.935 --> 11:26.811
Shit.

11:27.312 --> 11:28.146
[grunts]

11:29.147 --> 11:30.732
Hey, Vic.

11:31.358 --> 11:34.569
Vic. Victor. Vic, wake up.

11:34.569 --> 11:36.321
Victor! Hey!

11:37.238 --> 11:38.198
Vic.

11:38.323 --> 11:39.657
Where the fuck is Ma?

11:40.825 --> 11:41.701
Where is she?

11:41.826 --> 11:43.161
- I don't--
- Come on.

11:43.286 --> 11:44.621
[breathing heavily]

11:44.621 --> 11:46.289
Sofia... Sofia took her.

11:46.289 --> 11:47.332
Took her where? How?

11:47.457 --> 11:48.375
I don't know. I, um...

11:48.500 --> 11:50.335
We were dancing, and...

11:50.460 --> 11:52.087
- and the lights came on.
- [tires screeching]

11:52.087 --> 11:53.254
- Shut up.
- [shouting]

11:53.254 --> 11:54.673
[groans]

11:55.256 --> 11:57.050
- [car doors closing]
- [indistinct shouting]

11:57.050 --> 11:58.718
Fuck! It's Sal.

12:00.095 --> 12:02.263
Come on, Vic. You gotta get
outta here. Come on.

12:02.263 --> 12:03.390
You gotta go.

12:05.058 --> 12:06.434
- Get outta here.
- What about you?

12:06.434 --> 12:08.645
They got my ma.
I gotta face this head-on.

12:08.770 --> 12:11.189
All right, call Zhao,
Donny Boy. Go down the chain.

12:11.314 --> 12:12.691
Tell 'em what's going on.

12:12.816 --> 12:13.692
Oz, I'm sorry.

12:13.817 --> 12:14.818
Fuck your guilt.

12:15.902 --> 12:18.113
Just get me an army, kid. Go.

12:24.494 --> 12:29.374
[doors opening downstairs]

12:29.374 --> 12:31.376
[breathing heavily]

12:33.294 --> 12:34.379
[footsteps approaching]

12:34.504 --> 12:35.463
[door opens]

12:36.381 --> 12:37.882
Don't fuckin' move.

12:38.008 --> 12:39.217
Yeah, yeah.

12:40.510 --> 12:42.887
- [thump]
- Take it easy!

12:43.013 --> 12:43.972
I ain't resisting.

12:44.889 --> 12:45.765
Hey, Sal.

12:46.266 --> 12:48.935
- [thud]
- [Oz grunts, coughs]

12:49.060 --> 12:50.437
I found this at your place.

12:50.437 --> 12:52.689
Never cared much
for the game, myself.

12:52.689 --> 12:55.817
- [coughs]
- Too much sittin' and waitin'.

12:56.276 --> 12:57.402
[Oz grunts]

12:57.527 --> 12:59.070
Feels a little different,
doesn't it, Oz?

12:59.195 --> 13:01.990
No cops, no guards,
nothing to hold me back.

13:01.990 --> 13:05.285
- [blows landing]
- [grunts, gasps]

13:05.285 --> 13:08.288
- They were my blood. My wife!
- [groans]

13:08.288 --> 13:09.581
Sir, you have an agreement

13:09.706 --> 13:11.666
- with Ms. Gigante.
- My son! My heart!

13:11.666 --> 13:13.918
- You filthy piece of shit!
- Sir!

13:14.044 --> 13:17.172
Sofia got you on a tight leash,
huh, Sal?

13:17.172 --> 13:18.298
[Salvatore] Nah. Nah, nah.

13:18.590 --> 13:21.593
She and I, we want
the same things in the end.

13:21.718 --> 13:25.847
[Oz grunts, groans]

13:25.847 --> 13:28.350
[Salvatore sighs] Yeah.

13:28.350 --> 13:32.020
That's just a little taste
of what you got comin'.

13:32.562 --> 13:33.772
We got your mother.

13:34.272 --> 13:35.106
Yeah.

13:35.231 --> 13:37.025
We got your family now.

13:38.943 --> 13:43.573
- [toast scraping dryly]
- [classical music playing]

13:43.573 --> 13:49.788
[phone vibrating]

13:51.998 --> 13:53.166
Good morning.

13:53.166 --> 13:54.959
[Salvatore on phone]
Sofia, I got him.

13:55.794 --> 13:57.128
How's the old lady?

13:57.128 --> 13:59.881
Sofia! Jesus,
don't-don't hurt her!

13:59.881 --> 14:01.257
She got nothin' to do with this.

14:01.257 --> 14:02.967
Come on!
I'll do whatever you want.

14:03.093 --> 14:05.303
- [Salvatore] You hear that?
- Do you feel better?

14:05.762 --> 14:07.972
[Salvatore sighs]
It's not enough, Sofia.

14:08.098 --> 14:09.974
I know. Have patience.

14:10.100 --> 14:11.351
We're gonna kill him soon.

14:11.351 --> 14:12.644
[Salvatore] Okay, okay.

14:13.269 --> 14:15.188
I'll call you
when we're headed your way.

14:17.691 --> 14:19.359
You're taking us
to see your operation.

14:19.484 --> 14:21.820
I ain't doin' shit
till I know my ma's all right.

14:22.487 --> 14:23.571
Just let me talk to her.

14:25.657 --> 14:27.492
Are you tryin'
to make a deal, Oz?

14:27.951 --> 14:28.910
With me?

14:29.369 --> 14:32.163
Nothin' personal, remember?

14:32.163 --> 14:33.665
Huh? Just part of the game.

14:34.332 --> 14:35.917
I hold up my end.
You hold up yours.

14:35.917 --> 14:38.586
You remember?
You said that to me. Right?

14:38.586 --> 14:40.505
You looked me right in the eye,

14:40.630 --> 14:42.132
like a gentleman,

14:42.132 --> 14:44.843
and you assured me
you wouldn't hurt my family.

14:46.386 --> 14:48.847
Guess what. I'm a gentleman too,

14:48.972 --> 14:51.474
and I'm gonna give you
the exact same deal.

14:51.474 --> 14:52.517
Go on.

15:00.066 --> 15:01.192
[knocking on door]

15:08.116 --> 15:09.868
[Sofia] I brought you breakfast.

15:22.422 --> 15:23.506
You nervous?

15:23.506 --> 15:24.716
No.

15:30.680 --> 15:32.057
Francis Cobb...

15:32.599 --> 15:34.309
That's your name, right?

15:35.852 --> 15:38.146
You know, Oz told me
you died a few years back.

15:38.146 --> 15:40.982
- Mmm.
- He was torn up about it, too.

15:41.775 --> 15:44.736
I actually felt bad for him.

15:45.278 --> 15:46.738
Yeah, well...

15:46.738 --> 15:48.823
some people are easy marks.

15:49.407 --> 15:50.492
[Sofia] Mmm.

15:50.492 --> 15:52.494
So, did you bring me
all the way out here

15:52.494 --> 15:54.412
to feed me toast,
or you gonna kill me?

15:54.537 --> 15:55.455
[chuckles]

15:57.916 --> 15:59.250
Depends on your son.

16:01.586 --> 16:03.338
He's with Salvatore Maroni
right now.

16:03.338 --> 16:06.174
And if Oz leads us to the drugs
that he stole from me,

16:06.174 --> 16:08.051
then there are options.

16:08.051 --> 16:09.844
You don't know shit
about my boy, do ya?

16:10.970 --> 16:12.138
He's gonna roast Sal

16:12.138 --> 16:13.848
like he did his wife
and their bastard son,

16:13.848 --> 16:15.100
and then he's comin' for you.

16:16.768 --> 16:18.436
You have a lot of confidence
in your son.

16:18.561 --> 16:19.604
Yes, I do.

16:25.985 --> 16:27.696
So how'd you end up here then?

16:29.614 --> 16:30.949
[toast crunches]

16:31.074 --> 16:33.868
You know, Oswald used
to rave about this house,

16:33.868 --> 16:35.245
how beautiful it was,

16:35.245 --> 16:38.289
but I...
I just ain't so impressed.

16:39.749 --> 16:42.877
This place ain't got
no goddamn personality.

16:42.877 --> 16:45.505
You afraid of color
or somethin'?

16:47.841 --> 16:49.134
You can blame my father.

16:50.176 --> 16:53.138
The Falcones were...
a bit conservative.

16:53.263 --> 16:56.433
Oh, yeah, that's right.
You're a... What? A Gigante now.

16:56.433 --> 16:58.768
Yeah, yeah. Oswald told me.

16:58.768 --> 17:00.353
What are you gonna do next?

17:00.478 --> 17:03.231
Dye your hair pink?
Get an ass tattoo?

17:03.690 --> 17:05.442
That'll teach
your daddy a lesson.

17:05.442 --> 17:06.693
[laughs derisively]

17:06.818 --> 17:08.236
[Sofia chuckles]

17:09.612 --> 17:10.989
Oz tells you a lot, huh?

17:11.489 --> 17:12.699
Yes, he does.

17:15.368 --> 17:17.328
[dragging chair noisily]

17:20.415 --> 17:21.541
I'll be honest with you.

17:22.876 --> 17:24.586
All those years working
for my family,

17:24.586 --> 17:27.380
I never gave much thought
to Oz's childhood.

17:27.964 --> 17:30.300
I know the, uh, highlights,
of course.

17:30.425 --> 17:32.052
He loves making a meal
out of those.

17:32.802 --> 17:34.346
"I'm an Eastside kid.

17:34.471 --> 17:35.764
I got a bum leg.

17:36.514 --> 17:37.932
No father."

17:37.932 --> 17:41.186
But those things don't make you
a monster, do they?

17:41.853 --> 17:44.064
Someone shaped him.

17:44.731 --> 17:46.399
- [laughs]
- [chuckles]

17:47.317 --> 17:50.111
Okay, you wanna know
about my boy, Oswald?

17:51.029 --> 17:51.905
Please.

17:52.697 --> 17:54.366
He's always two steps ahead.

17:54.491 --> 17:56.368
All those years,
driving you around,

17:57.202 --> 17:58.870
cleanin' up after you
and your family,

17:58.995 --> 18:01.373
he was watchin', studyin'.

18:01.915 --> 18:03.500
He knows this game better
than you.

18:04.084 --> 18:06.878
You changed your name. So what?

18:07.003 --> 18:08.630
Okay, you think
everything's different now.

18:08.630 --> 18:10.590
That don't change the game, sweetheart.

18:11.716 --> 18:13.051
Drugs is drugs.

18:13.176 --> 18:16.304
Crack, Bliss, dope, Drops...
it's all the same shit.

18:17.347 --> 18:18.807
Same winners, same losers.

18:19.349 --> 18:21.267
So, you call yourself
whatever the hell you want,

18:21.267 --> 18:25.230
but when my Oswald puts a bullet

18:25.355 --> 18:27.482
in that pretty little skull
of yours,

18:27.482 --> 18:31.277
I'll be tap-dancing
on your grave,

18:31.277 --> 18:33.822
like Ginger fucking Rogers.

18:35.657 --> 18:37.200
It's a good thing
your other boys died

18:37.200 --> 18:39.786
before you could turn
them into monsters like Oz, huh?

18:39.911 --> 18:41.454
You shut your goddamn mouth.

18:41.579 --> 18:42.997
What happened to them?

18:42.997 --> 18:44.457
Are they even dead?

18:45.959 --> 18:47.919
Or is Oz keeping them locked up

18:48.044 --> 18:51.464
in some Eastside slum, too?

18:55.218 --> 18:56.052
What are you--

18:59.764 --> 19:01.349
Why would you-- Wh--

19:06.146 --> 19:07.272
You hear it too, don't you?

19:08.398 --> 19:09.315
[Sofia] Hmm?

19:09.441 --> 19:10.734
The rain-rain.

19:12.610 --> 19:13.445
[sniffs]

19:15.405 --> 19:17.115
[crying] They shoulda been home.

19:17.741 --> 19:19.284
I went lookin'
all goddamn night.

19:19.909 --> 19:22.245
You should be scouring
the streets for Christ's sake.

19:22.245 --> 19:24.039
That's your job, ain't it?

19:24.789 --> 19:27.208
Put out a goddamn report,
something!

19:27.208 --> 19:30.587
I told ya.
Jack is 15. Benny's 10.

19:31.046 --> 19:33.006
- Your boys?
- Yeah.

19:33.506 --> 19:34.841
Jack and Benny?

19:34.841 --> 19:36.843
No one seen 'em at the movies.
The arcade's closed.

19:36.843 --> 19:38.178
Probably soakin' wet
and cold.

19:38.178 --> 19:39.512
They didn't have
their umbrellas,

19:39.637 --> 19:41.389
and it's been rainin' all night.

19:41.931 --> 19:45.685
Please, you gotta find 'em.
It's been too long. [sniffs]

19:47.437 --> 19:48.646
[gentle music playing]

19:50.857 --> 19:54.652
Francis, where do you think
you are right now?

19:57.155 --> 19:58.031
Francis?

20:00.658 --> 20:01.576
[sniffs]

20:06.623 --> 20:08.708
Yeah, you get the fuck away
from me.

20:08.833 --> 20:10.001
[music turns menacing]

20:13.546 --> 20:15.882
[kettle steaming]

20:26.559 --> 20:28.228
[door opens]

20:28.353 --> 20:29.354
[Julian] Sofia?

20:33.191 --> 20:34.025
[door closes]

20:34.025 --> 20:35.110
Why are you here?

20:35.110 --> 20:36.695
[Julian] We may have a problem.

20:36.820 --> 20:40.407
I have a friend that works
at Brookside Children's Home.

20:41.032 --> 20:42.701
She's a psychiatrist.

20:44.244 --> 20:45.995
Brookside is
the residential facility

20:45.995 --> 20:47.706
that's looking after
your cousin Gia.

20:48.248 --> 20:49.374
Okay.

20:49.541 --> 20:52.127
Evidently, she's asking
to speak to the police.

20:52.877 --> 20:54.713
She's the only loose end
from the gassing.

20:55.505 --> 20:57.215
But Gia saw something
that night.

20:58.258 --> 20:59.926
Do you know
what she might have seen?

21:00.885 --> 21:01.678
No.

21:01.678 --> 21:03.388
[suspenseful music playing]

21:05.098 --> 21:06.057
I don't know.

21:06.766 --> 21:08.476
I don't want this
to be a burden to you.

21:08.476 --> 21:09.436
[kettle whistling]

21:09.561 --> 21:10.729
And I'm happy...

21:11.688 --> 21:12.605
to speak to her.

21:14.691 --> 21:16.484
Sofia, if she talks...

21:18.945 --> 21:20.989
[whistling subsides]

21:20.989 --> 21:22.073
I'll keep her quiet.

21:22.907 --> 21:24.451
But I could use your help...

21:24.993 --> 21:26.119
with something else.

21:26.745 --> 21:28.538
[tense music playing]

21:42.552 --> 21:43.428
[Julian] Francis.

21:44.637 --> 21:46.014
I'm Dr. Rush.

21:46.014 --> 21:47.974
I'd like to ask you
a few questions.

21:51.728 --> 21:53.605
[machinery whining]

21:58.109 --> 21:59.361
[whirring]

22:03.823 --> 22:04.783
[metallic thud]

22:13.958 --> 22:15.669
[gunfire]

22:19.255 --> 22:20.757
Get back! Everybody, get back!

22:20.757 --> 22:22.467
[gun firing]

22:23.677 --> 22:26.179
[menacing music playing]

22:26.304 --> 22:27.305
Jesus.

22:29.808 --> 22:30.767
[grunts]

22:34.979 --> 22:36.231
This place is filthy.

22:36.773 --> 22:39.401
Figures you'd tuck your tail
into a shit pipe.

22:40.485 --> 22:42.195
Listen up, everybody.

22:42.195 --> 22:45.907
Oswald Cobb
is no longer in charge.

22:46.991 --> 22:48.326
As of now,

22:48.451 --> 22:52.372
you all work for the Gigante
and the Maroni families.

22:52.497 --> 22:55.208
So I want you
to pack up this product

22:55.333 --> 22:58.378
quickly and quietly. All right?

22:58.503 --> 23:00.547
- The fuck are you lookin' at?
- Hey, easy.

23:00.547 --> 23:02.549
- Fuck that!
- Hey. Hey, hey, hey.

23:02.674 --> 23:03.842
All right, I understand.

23:04.801 --> 23:07.012
You need a minute
to process this.

23:07.137 --> 23:08.722
You take that time now.

23:10.515 --> 23:12.350
Good. Get back to work!

23:16.688 --> 23:18.940
Listen, Sal, you got
some hate out. That's good.

23:19.983 --> 23:20.984
I gave you what you want.

23:20.984 --> 23:23.278
This whole thing,
it's yours now.

23:23.862 --> 23:25.363
Start of a whole new empire.

23:27.115 --> 23:29.367
Why you gonna share it
with Carmine's daughter, huh?

23:30.076 --> 23:30.952
Jesus!

23:31.494 --> 23:33.872
After everything
the Falcones took from you...

23:34.873 --> 23:36.207
Look at this shit.

23:37.542 --> 23:39.377
You got access
to the whole city.

23:40.378 --> 23:41.546
Just like a sewer rat.

23:43.340 --> 23:46.468
After we finishing packing up
Sofia's drugs,

23:46.468 --> 23:48.053
I'm gonna take you to her place.

23:49.346 --> 23:51.056
That's where you die, Oz.

23:51.890 --> 23:54.142
Only thing left
for her and I to figure out

23:54.851 --> 23:56.061
is how we're gonna do it.

23:56.561 --> 23:57.896
[chuckles]

24:01.024 --> 24:03.360
You know what
I'll never forget, Sal?

24:03.360 --> 24:04.486
It's the smell.

24:05.737 --> 24:07.072
The burning flesh,

24:07.614 --> 24:09.574
you know, muscle, fat, shit.

24:10.075 --> 24:11.117
The smell of hair.

24:11.659 --> 24:13.578
I didn't anticipate that.

24:13.703 --> 24:15.121
It's real distinct.

24:15.830 --> 24:17.791
Tell me somethin'.
Did your beautiful wife, Nadia,

24:17.791 --> 24:19.793
did she wear a special kind
of hairspray or somethin'?

24:19.793 --> 24:22.504
'Cause, man, she went up
like a tinderbox.

24:22.504 --> 24:23.755
[Salvatore growls angrily]

24:26.216 --> 24:27.509
Gimme a light.

24:29.094 --> 24:31.680
Mr. Maroni,
don't fucking touch--

24:32.555 --> 24:33.473
[overlapping shouting]

24:33.598 --> 24:34.599
[grunting]

24:37.435 --> 24:38.853
[thudding]

24:38.853 --> 24:39.813
[grunts]

24:41.439 --> 24:42.816
[gun firing]

24:46.403 --> 24:47.487
[bottles clanking]

24:47.612 --> 24:48.780
[both grunting]

24:49.572 --> 24:50.573
[thumping]

24:50.573 --> 24:52.492
[Salvatore grunting]

24:52.617 --> 24:54.119
- [glass shatters]
- [Oz groans]

24:54.244 --> 24:56.538
- [Salvatore growls angrily]
- [blows landing]

24:56.538 --> 25:00.458
[both grunting]

25:06.423 --> 25:07.215
[thud]

25:07.215 --> 25:08.633
Motherfucker.

25:08.758 --> 25:11.845
- [blows landing]
- [Oz groaning]

25:11.845 --> 25:13.263
[Salvatore growls angrily]

25:13.263 --> 25:15.390
[Salvatore groaning]

25:16.182 --> 25:19.352
[Salvatore wheezing]

25:20.854 --> 25:22.480
[wheezing]

25:22.605 --> 25:24.315
[groans, exhales]

25:25.483 --> 25:26.401
What are you doin'?

25:27.402 --> 25:28.737
Come on, you bastard. Let's go.

25:28.737 --> 25:30.822
- [wheezing]
- What are you doin'?

25:30.947 --> 25:32.323
Let's go.

25:32.449 --> 25:35.618
- [Salvatore groaning, gasping]
- Come on. Come on!

25:35.618 --> 25:36.619
[gasps]

25:36.619 --> 25:37.620
[thuds heavily]

25:37.620 --> 25:39.039
Oh.

25:39.039 --> 25:41.082
- [Salvatore gasping]
- Oh, hell no. No, no, no, no.

25:41.958 --> 25:44.336
Sal, Sal, look at me.
Look at me!

25:44.461 --> 25:45.587
[gasping]

25:45.587 --> 25:47.213
I beat you, Sal.

25:47.213 --> 25:49.799
You hear me? I beat you. I win.

25:49.799 --> 25:51.551
[exhales]

25:51.676 --> 25:52.802
[breathing stops]

25:52.802 --> 25:54.637
[indistinct shouting
in distance]

25:59.351 --> 26:00.352
The fuck?!

26:03.188 --> 26:05.231
Come on. Jesus Christ!

26:07.317 --> 26:09.611
You were supposed
to destroy me, Sal!

26:09.611 --> 26:12.739
Show me what a big man you are,
what a fucking big man you are!

26:13.323 --> 26:14.699
Huh? Well, I got you.

26:14.824 --> 26:16.493
I fucking got you!

26:16.493 --> 26:18.870
You filthy, stupid prick!

26:18.995 --> 26:19.954
Fuck you!

26:21.164 --> 26:22.749
Tryin' to steal from me?

26:23.875 --> 26:26.378
Try to take what's mine,
what I built?

26:28.421 --> 26:29.589
What'd you say?

26:30.507 --> 26:31.716
I didn't hear ya.

26:31.841 --> 26:32.884
Say it again.

26:35.178 --> 26:37.639
Yeah. Didn't think so.

26:39.724 --> 26:40.642
[gun fires]

26:41.643 --> 26:43.478
[gun fires repeatedly]

26:45.897 --> 26:47.649
I beat you, Salvatore Maroni.

26:48.858 --> 26:49.901
[exhales]

26:55.615 --> 26:57.909
[indistinct shouting
in distance]

26:59.077 --> 27:01.621
[thudding in distance]

27:08.795 --> 27:09.963
I win.

27:10.088 --> 27:11.423
[electricity buzzing]

27:11.548 --> 27:12.590
[body thuds heavily]

27:12.716 --> 27:14.134
[menacing music playing]

27:16.469 --> 27:17.846
Everybody gather round.

27:21.391 --> 27:22.267
This man...

27:24.602 --> 27:25.603
his men...

27:26.563 --> 27:28.064
dead, 'cause you did
the right thing.

27:28.064 --> 27:30.442
You protected your home,
your investment.

27:32.485 --> 27:35.113
I'm proud of ya, grateful to ya.

27:35.238 --> 27:36.239
But this ain't over.

27:37.615 --> 27:38.783
There's a storm comin'.

27:40.785 --> 27:42.370
I'm gonna need your help.

27:42.370 --> 27:44.289
[up-tempo tense music playing]

27:46.791 --> 27:48.626
[woman] This way, Miss Gigante.

28:00.221 --> 28:01.014
[knocks on door]

28:01.139 --> 28:02.849
[eerie musical sting]

28:02.974 --> 28:05.310
[discordant music playing]

28:05.435 --> 28:06.269
End it!

28:06.269 --> 28:07.520
Gia, you have a visitor.

28:12.359 --> 28:13.651
[Sofia] Hi.

28:20.784 --> 28:21.659
Thank you.

28:26.039 --> 28:26.915
[door shuts]

28:33.004 --> 28:37.050
I know your doctor
has been asking questions.

28:39.511 --> 28:41.513
Did you tell her
that you saw something?

28:44.307 --> 28:45.684
I'm here to help you.

28:46.226 --> 28:48.520
It's okay. You can tell me.

28:51.064 --> 28:52.190
What did you see?

28:54.693 --> 28:57.404
I... saw a mask.

28:58.905 --> 28:59.781
In your bag.

29:03.576 --> 29:04.703
Did you kill them?

29:06.329 --> 29:07.455
My mom and my dad?

29:08.498 --> 29:09.708
Is that what you think?

29:12.711 --> 29:13.545
That...

29:14.504 --> 29:15.714
I would do something...

29:17.173 --> 29:18.967
as horrible as that?

29:21.886 --> 29:22.929
Gia.

29:23.054 --> 29:24.931
I loved your mom and dad.

29:27.851 --> 29:30.770
I know you want someone
to blame.

29:32.397 --> 29:34.482
But it was nobody's fault.

29:36.901 --> 29:39.487
It was a terrible accident.

29:40.113 --> 29:41.573
Do you understand?

29:45.410 --> 29:46.286
Good.

29:57.756 --> 30:00.258
[ominous music playing]

30:02.260 --> 30:03.928
Did you do this to yourself?

30:17.776 --> 30:18.777
Come here.

30:21.112 --> 30:21.988
Come here.

30:33.500 --> 30:35.293
It might sound confusing...

30:37.128 --> 30:40.382
and I know that it hurts...

30:42.759 --> 30:46.054
but your mom and your dad,
everyone in our family,

30:47.389 --> 30:49.224
they were bad people,

30:49.224 --> 30:50.809
who deserved it.

30:51.726 --> 30:54.312
And I am glad that they're gone.

30:56.022 --> 30:58.483
Don't hurt yourself
because of them.

31:01.277 --> 31:02.362
This is a gift.

31:04.781 --> 31:06.157
You're gonna get out of here,

31:07.117 --> 31:08.827
and you're gonna find
a new home.

31:12.205 --> 31:13.081
And...

31:15.458 --> 31:17.002
whatever woman you become...

31:20.130 --> 31:22.215
you deserve much better than...

31:22.215 --> 31:24.384
what this family
could have offered.

31:29.973 --> 31:30.807
[Sofia sniffs]

31:30.807 --> 31:32.350
[somber music playing]

31:38.481 --> 31:44.738
[panting]

31:55.165 --> 31:56.207
[sniffs]

31:56.332 --> 31:57.625
[phone vibrating]

32:02.881 --> 32:03.840
Salvatore.

32:03.840 --> 32:06.134
Nah. Sal's dead, sweetheart.

32:06.134 --> 32:08.094
[sighs] Take it in.

32:09.262 --> 32:11.389
It ain't how you were hopin'
it'd go.

32:12.182 --> 32:13.558
You wanna kill me.

32:14.559 --> 32:15.477
I get it.

32:17.854 --> 32:19.647
But there is one thing
you want more.

32:20.398 --> 32:23.485
Ever since I known ya, you know,
you had your eye on the throne.

32:23.485 --> 32:24.736
Now it's your chance.

32:25.737 --> 32:27.113
All you gotta do
is bring her to me,

32:27.113 --> 32:28.073
just bring her to me.

32:28.907 --> 32:30.992
Not a hair on her head
out of place.

32:31.618 --> 32:34.204
I'll give it to you,
the whole fuckin' thing,

32:34.204 --> 32:36.998
the Bliss, my operation,
my connects.

32:37.624 --> 32:40.168
The keys to the fuckin' kingdom
are here, Sofia.

32:44.214 --> 32:45.173
Whaddya say?

32:46.966 --> 32:48.760
[tense music playing]

32:48.885 --> 32:50.762
[Julian] And then it was just
you and Oz.

32:52.597 --> 32:53.765
Tell me how that felt.

32:54.599 --> 32:55.475
Go with it.

32:58.436 --> 32:59.312
Julian.

33:01.731 --> 33:03.983
[swallows hard]
I need to talk to you.

33:09.781 --> 33:11.116
[door thuds shut]

33:12.742 --> 33:14.869
Salvatore Maroni is dead.

33:14.869 --> 33:16.830
Oz... killed him.

33:18.498 --> 33:19.624
Are you all right?

33:20.083 --> 33:22.085
Oz wants me
to bring him his mother

33:22.085 --> 33:24.379
in exchange for the product.
[inhales deeply]

33:24.379 --> 33:26.089
And, uh...

33:26.089 --> 33:27.007
I agreed.

33:27.132 --> 33:29.592
No. Sofia, it's a trap.

33:29.592 --> 33:30.719
I know.

33:31.678 --> 33:33.138
But it doesn't matter.

33:34.305 --> 33:35.765
None of it matters.

33:35.765 --> 33:37.308
What did Gia say to you?

33:38.768 --> 33:39.978
Is she gonna be a problem?

33:42.814 --> 33:44.983
Before my father put me away,

33:45.692 --> 33:48.486
he wanted me
to take over the Family.

33:50.488 --> 33:53.158
He put me in an institution.

33:54.284 --> 33:57.871
And the second I got out,
I walked...

33:59.497 --> 34:00.999
right into another one.

34:02.417 --> 34:03.293
She's right.

34:04.044 --> 34:07.422
Francis is right. I thought
I was doing something different,

34:07.422 --> 34:10.050
and I... I thought that I...

34:10.050 --> 34:11.718
I thought that I was different.

34:11.718 --> 34:15.096
But I'm still playing
my father's game.

34:15.096 --> 34:18.016
I'm-I'm abiding by his rules.

34:18.141 --> 34:19.601
I-- [breathing heavily]

34:19.601 --> 34:21.186
Jesus Christ, I can't...

34:22.687 --> 34:24.230
breathe. [gasps]

34:24.230 --> 34:25.607
I can't breathe.
I can't breathe.

34:25.607 --> 34:26.941
Sofia, look at me.

34:26.941 --> 34:28.526
[panting]

34:28.651 --> 34:31.321
Your father's hand
is not on your throat anymore.

34:31.321 --> 34:35.909
It doesn't matter what he
or anyone else wanted for you.

34:35.909 --> 34:37.535
[breathing heavily]

34:39.079 --> 34:40.080
What do you want?

34:43.249 --> 34:44.751
I wanna be free.

34:47.671 --> 34:48.838
[exhales slowly]

34:50.048 --> 34:51.383
I wanna be free.

34:57.889 --> 34:59.641
And I want Oz to feel pain...

35:01.893 --> 35:03.478
real pain,

35:05.230 --> 35:07.941
the kind that I have felt.

35:12.779 --> 35:14.614
I need him to suffer...

35:16.199 --> 35:17.492
for what he's done.

35:20.745 --> 35:22.789
Richie, you heard from Vic?

35:22.914 --> 35:24.666
Nah. I just keep getting
his voicemail.

35:25.375 --> 35:26.251
[quietly] All right.

35:27.836 --> 35:28.712
[loudly] All right!

35:29.629 --> 35:31.589
I know this ain't the job
you signed up for.

35:32.215 --> 35:33.925
But you're the only army I got.

35:34.050 --> 35:35.385
I wouldn't ask for another.

35:35.385 --> 35:36.428
All right?

35:37.345 --> 35:38.221
Come on.

35:39.973 --> 35:41.683
- [walkie-talkie squawks]
- [Zeke] Oz?

35:42.142 --> 35:43.268
Zeke, you got somethin'?

35:44.269 --> 35:46.688
[Zeke] There's a black G-Wagen
heading your way.

35:47.397 --> 35:48.273
That's our girl.

35:49.399 --> 35:50.775
All right, everybody
out of sight.

35:51.943 --> 35:54.154
Fingers off triggers
till I give the word.

35:54.154 --> 35:57.407
[Zeke] Car's inside the tunnels.
Gates are closed and locked.

35:57.407 --> 35:58.450
Good.

36:00.785 --> 36:01.786
[exhales]

36:11.838 --> 36:13.715
Come on, doll.

36:31.483 --> 36:32.817
What are you waitin' for?

36:35.487 --> 36:36.738
[phone ringing]

36:48.958 --> 36:49.959
Hi.

36:50.460 --> 36:51.878
Sweetheart,
there ain't no goin' back.

36:52.003 --> 36:52.962
The doors are locked.

36:52.962 --> 36:54.756
I got your product.
You got my ma.

36:54.756 --> 36:56.383
As long as she's okay...

36:57.300 --> 36:58.259
we're good here.

37:01.012 --> 37:02.514
We gonna stare
at each other all night?

37:02.639 --> 37:03.890
You wanna finish this? Come on.

37:04.015 --> 37:06.351
Your mother is
a very interesting woman, Oz.

37:06.476 --> 37:07.727
Yeah, I know what my mother is.

37:07.852 --> 37:09.896
[Sofia] She helped me realize
a few things.

37:10.730 --> 37:12.649
I keep trying on
all these different faces,

37:12.649 --> 37:13.692
but...

37:14.484 --> 37:16.528
none of them feel quite right.

37:16.653 --> 37:18.113
[engine revs]

37:20.365 --> 37:22.659
[tense music playing]

37:26.913 --> 37:29.040
- [tires crunching]
- [brakes squeaking]

37:35.046 --> 37:36.047
[door opens]

37:37.048 --> 37:39.426
- Hey! Hey!
- [footsteps running away]

37:41.261 --> 37:42.137
Hey.

37:43.847 --> 37:45.598
What the fuck is goin' on?

37:45.598 --> 37:47.308
[Sofia] You think you know
what I want.

37:47.308 --> 37:49.602
That it's the same
for you and me.

37:49.728 --> 37:51.021
Of course you do.

37:52.022 --> 37:54.566
I guess this game was made
for men like you...

37:55.108 --> 37:56.067
like my father.

37:56.860 --> 37:57.986
Same winners.

37:58.570 --> 37:59.779
Same losers.

38:00.363 --> 38:03.742
It's why everyone expected me
to die in Arkham.

38:03.867 --> 38:05.618
No one even considered

38:06.411 --> 38:08.246
that I might learn something
there...

38:11.416 --> 38:13.084
how to play new games.

38:15.420 --> 38:17.589
[Oz breathing heavily]

38:18.631 --> 38:19.758
I left ya a present.

38:20.258 --> 38:22.552
[breathing heavily]

38:22.552 --> 38:23.762
[Sofia] You find it yet?

38:23.887 --> 38:25.430
[music intensifies]

38:29.309 --> 38:31.019
Yo, Oz, what's goin' on?

38:37.275 --> 38:39.361
[music crescendos, softens]

38:42.072 --> 38:43.615
[gentle music playing]

38:56.920 --> 38:57.796
[beeping]

38:58.296 --> 39:00.298
[Richie] Oz, what's in the car?

39:00.799 --> 39:02.008
Oh, fuck!

39:02.133 --> 39:03.760
[Sofia] There's enough time
to get out,

39:03.760 --> 39:05.178
I think.

39:06.930 --> 39:09.474
If you do, come by and see us.

39:10.892 --> 39:12.185
[menacing music playing]

39:14.771 --> 39:18.692
[indistinct shouting
in distance]

39:18.817 --> 39:20.360
[man] Oh, my God! It's a bomb!

39:21.611 --> 39:23.196
- [indistinct shouting]
- [bomb exploding]

39:23.321 --> 39:25.365
- [workers shouting]
- [fire whooshing]

39:27.784 --> 39:29.994
[explosion echoing]

39:30.120 --> 39:32.664
[clock chiming]

39:32.789 --> 39:34.499
[aluminum foil rustling]

39:52.308 --> 39:53.184
Ma?

39:54.019 --> 39:55.186
I got dinner for ya.

39:58.815 --> 40:00.567
[sighs heavily]

40:09.951 --> 40:11.036
You're up.

40:11.161 --> 40:12.412
Get dressed.

40:13.163 --> 40:14.080
We're goin' out.

40:14.581 --> 40:15.915
[jazz music playing]

40:15.915 --> 40:17.083
Go on. Your suit.

40:23.381 --> 40:27.761
[woman singing]
♪ Please tell me now ♪

40:31.139 --> 40:35.769
♪ How much you care ♪

40:37.479 --> 40:40.398
♪ Before we say ♪

40:43.068 --> 40:47.989
♪ Goodnight, my dear ♪

40:49.282 --> 40:52.410
♪ You'll never say ♪

40:56.289 --> 40:57.707
♪ That you'll be... ♪

40:57.707 --> 41:00.001
I can't do this alone no more.

41:00.669 --> 41:02.212
You have to promise me

41:02.212 --> 41:04.756
that you're gonna make something
of yourself,

41:05.715 --> 41:09.678
that you'll get me
every goddamn thing I deserve.

41:12.222 --> 41:13.932
Or I ain't gonna make it.

41:14.557 --> 41:17.769
I don't know how else
I can live with this, Oswald.

41:17.894 --> 41:19.854
But you'll make me happy.

41:19.854 --> 41:23.108
[crying] 'Cause I deserve
a happy life.

41:25.068 --> 41:25.944
Don't I?

41:27.821 --> 41:30.281
Don't I, Oswald? Tell me.

41:30.407 --> 41:31.783
Course you do, Ma.

41:32.784 --> 41:35.995
You deserve the best life,

41:37.497 --> 41:39.124
and I'm gonna get it for ya.

41:41.084 --> 41:42.335
I promise.

41:44.963 --> 41:46.798
And I ain't gonna quit
till I do.

41:48.466 --> 41:49.968
[Francis sniffs]

41:49.968 --> 41:56.766
♪ Please tell me, love ♪

41:56.766 --> 41:59.519
♪ Ooh, ooh, ooh, ooh ♪

41:59.644 --> 42:01.938
[jazz song echoes]

42:01.938 --> 42:04.024
- [high-pitched ringing]
- [muffled audio]

42:04.149 --> 42:06.401
- [Oz gasps and coughs]
- [steady heartbeat thumps]

42:10.405 --> 42:11.740
[wheezing]

42:20.999 --> 42:21.875
[gasps]

42:31.676 --> 42:33.511
[distant sirens wail]

42:45.523 --> 42:48.109
[panting]

42:48.109 --> 42:50.570
[helicopters flying overhead]

42:59.537 --> 43:01.539
- [Oz's ears popping]
- [audio no longer muffled]

43:01.664 --> 43:03.416
- [people shouting]
- [sirens approaching]

43:12.967 --> 43:14.135
Vic?

43:18.014 --> 43:21.017
[chuckling] Well,
if ain't the Penguin.

43:21.017 --> 43:22.977
- You made it.
- The fuck did you call me?

43:23.895 --> 43:25.313
Sofia wants to see ya.

43:26.731 --> 43:27.607
- [thud]
- [Oz grunts]

43:28.108 --> 43:29.484
["Lunacy" by Swans playing]

43:52.549 --> 43:56.428
♪ In the mind of no one ♪

43:56.428 --> 44:00.598
♪ Forming sun, forming love ♪

44:00.724 --> 44:04.728
♪ Break the chain,
hide within ♪

44:04.728 --> 44:08.690
♪ Innocence, not innocent ♪

44:08.690 --> 44:12.777
♪ Innocent, in no sense ♪

44:12.902 --> 44:16.781
♪ Eat the beast, keep him in ♪

44:16.906 --> 44:20.869
♪ Take the blame,
speak the name ♪

44:20.869 --> 44:24.873
♪ Lunacy, lunacy ♪

44:24.873 --> 44:29.127
♪ Hide beneath
your monkey skin ♪

44:29.127 --> 44:33.131
♪ Feel his love, nurture him ♪

44:33.131 --> 44:37.093
♪ Kill the truth
or speak the name ♪

44:37.093 --> 44:45.477
♪ Lunacy, lunacy ♪

44:45.602 --> 44:56.988
♪ Lunacy, lunacy ♪

44:57.113 --> 44:58.865
♪ Lunacy ♪

45:02.660 --> 45:03.703
[song ends]

45:04.162 --> 45:06.122
[tense music playing]

45:32.232 --> 45:33.441
[music intensifies]

45:58.216 --> 46:00.218
[music ends]
